      "id": "claim_42e6eb0f59ce480882d248e681c51087",
      "statement": "The CLI is the single place that converts internal error carriers into output and exit code: finishWithErrors reports per-profile error entries plus top-level stepErrors and exits 1 when any exist, while finishMerge wraps a standalone merge step in try/catch so a pre-profile throw becomes a one-line stderr error, a 'Failed: the merge run failed.' summary, and exit 1 — never a raw stack trace.",
